      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:HnLond">Hn Lond</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="2" corresp="#wit-rs"><pb n="288" ed="#robertson"/>Et cives non placitabunt extra muros civitatis pro nullo placito.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-rs"><pb n="289" ed="#robertson"/>And the citizens shall not take part in any case whatsoever outside the city walls.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 288–289 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
      </div>
